@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = {{your_token_here}}

### Login pour obtenir un token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "producteur@example.com",
  "password": "motdepasse"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Récupérer les photos pour un produit
GET {{baseUrl}}/lots/photos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un lot avec une nouvelle image
POST {{baseUrl}}/lots/add
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newLot"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idLot": null,
  "price": 10.99,
  "initialQuantity": 100,
  "soldQuantity": 0,
  "reservedQuantity": 0,
  "remainingQuantity": 100,
  "withdrawnQuantity": 0,
  "lotStatus": "en attente",
  "availableDate": "2025-05-01",
  "proposalDate": "2025-04-18",
  "receptionDate": null,
  "productId": 1,
  "producerId": 1,
  "photoId": null,
  "responsible": null
}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="lot-image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./lot-image.png

--boundary--

### Créer un lot avec une photo existante
POST {{baseUrl}}/lots/add
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newLot"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idLot": null,
  "price": 15.99,
  "initialQuantity": 50,
  "soldQuantity": 0,
  "reservedQuantity": 0,
  "remainingQuantity": 50,
  "withdrawnQuantity": 0,
  "lotStatus": "en attente",
  "availableDate": "2025-05-01",
  "proposalDate": "2025-04-18",
  "receptionDate": null,
  "productId": 1,
  "producerId": 1,
  "photoId": 1,
  "responsible": null
}

--boundary--